tests/test_orchestration_acceptance_verification_evidence.py::test_reconciliation_clears_results_before_acceptance calls module.setup(...) without first installing the fake agent CLIs, unlike the other tests in the file (acceptance_prompt calls install_all(tmp_path, monkeypatch, models=("m1",))). On a machine with a real codex CLI it passes. On GitHub Actions it fails in every Fast Python job and the Full regression job (run 38077160672) with:
